<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT TO BUY PLN 57 MLN IRON ORE.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT TO BUY PLN 57 MLN IRON ORE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA has signed a contract to buy South African iron ore worth 57 million zlotys for the state-owned Huta Katowice steel mill, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said that the ore is to be delivered from April 1997 to March, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
